        },
        {
          "text": " Konye ejai acoa nakinera kama kaluapolokoto konye mam erai acoa naka ikar kalu, karaida naka ikayaitok luka ikar kalu, luepote amameun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
